<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to StudioFlow</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #0f172a; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; background: #1e293b; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #334155; }
    .header { background: #0f172a; padding: 32px 40px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; }
    .brand { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #38bdf8; }
    .brand strong { color: #cbd5e1; }
    .body { padding: 36px 40px; color: #cbd5e1; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #f1f5f9; }
    p { margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #94a3b8; }
    .studio-badge { display: inline-block; background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 16px; margin: 8px 0 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 600; }
    .studio-badge span { color: #38bdf8; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #0ea5e9; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 13px 28px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 8px 0 24px; }
    .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #334155; margin: 24px 0; }
    .checklist { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 20px; }
    .checklist li { font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8; padding: 6px 0; }
    .checklist li::before { content: "✓ "; color: #22c55e; font-weight: 700; }
    .footer { padding: 20px 40px; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; border-top: 1px solid #334155; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="brand">Studio<strong>Flow</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <h1>Your studio is ready 🎉</h1>
      <p>Hi <%= @user.name.presence || @user.email %>, welcome to StudioFlow! Your account has been created and your studio is live.</p>

      <div class="studio-badge">
        <span>Studio</span>
        <%= @studio.name %>
      </div>

      <p>Here's what you can do right now:</p>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Add class templates and locations</li>
        <li>Schedule sessions and manage your calendar</li>
        <li>Invite clients to join your studio</li>
        <li>Set up payments and memberships</li>
      </ul>

      <a href="<%= @login_url %>" class="btn">Go to your studio</a>

      <hr class="divider">

      <p style="font-size:13px;color:#64748b">If you have any questions, reply to this email and we'll be happy to help.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      You received this email because you signed up as a studio owner on StudioFlow.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
